    "detailed_description": "Eshe's Wish Adventure is a traditional side scrolling platform game, with a cartoony cel shaded art style. You play as a cat trying to collect enough wish coins to get her greatest wish.<br><br>Eshe the cat has been teleported into the land of wishes. <br>You must guide her through wondrous realms to find magical wish coins!<br><br>Run, Jump, and meow your way through multiple themed levels.<br>You must collect coins to be able to enter magical portals.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967840/extras/Enemies.PNG?t=1668760858\" /></div><br>Game Features: <br>A cute main character<br>At least 3 unique enemies with their own abilities and style<br>Interactive objects within the environment<br>Collect coins to access more levels<br>Hidden easter eggs<br>A cel shaded cartoony art style.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967840/extras/missone.PNG?t=1668760858\" /></div><br><br>The game is designed to be easy to complete and celebrate the streamers who have helped out with the event in 2022.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967840/extras/309561d73e6ad6a20085eaf404b7daba.avif?t=1668760858\" /></div>",
